  "historyNote": "#5041, eff 1-9-91; ss by #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97 New. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98 New. #6806, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07 New. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #9877, eff 2-25-11; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26 (formerly Lab 206.02-Lab 206.04)",
